# Q&A

## What is Darsid Studio?

Darsid Studio is an independent animation project in development, building toward original animated productions and creative media.

## How old is Darsid Studio?

Wolf Den Studios publicly rebranded to Darsid Studio 9 months ago!

Fun fact: Wolf Den is 1 year, 6 months, and 15 days old! At the time I'm typing this, it's WAY OLDER THAN DARSID CURRENTLY (8 months)!

## What is Wolf Den?

Wolf Den was originally a place to hang out where YouTubers could directly interact with a multi-fanbase community!

It later changed course to become **Wolf Den Studios**, aiming to create an animated film, and was later rebranded to **Darsid Studio** with bigger goals and more effort!

## When did this all begin?

Wolf Den began 2 years ago with an entirely different goal!

## Who is Lone Yitoke?

Formerly known as Lone Wolf, THAT'S ME! :D The guy typing this, and I'm the owner!

## Can I donate to Darsid Studio?

At the moment, you can't :<. But when we release some videos, we'll soon have ways to donate to us if you've got extra pocket change!

## How big is the team?

Darsid productions, community moderation, and technical work are all handled mainly by me!

We do have people contributing, but they'd prefer to wait until Darsid has something to show! Kinda why I'm working my butt off to make you happy :D

## Who has the most aura?

Y'all do, and thanks for being here, especially while we don't have the most content or barely ANY to show.

I really hope we create a library big enough for any new viewers to come and discover our crazy, wacky journey, and for you to say with confidence that you were here at the start of the whole run!

Thanks for being here early. Love you, byeeeee!

