# Fun Facts

- Wolf Den Studio had gotten outperformed asset-wise by Darsid Studio before Darsid became older than the Den! (Logos, assets, resources.)
- The Co-Owner and Server Owner roles are cyan and red, just like our logo!
- Darsid's logo used to be the word Darsid with a slanted R! We didn't even have an icon.
- This server is approaching an interesting method of fairness within perks. You can just buy roles! But you can make a moment or be a part of something even without any perks!
- For example, booster perks cost a server boost, but the provided perks aren't all pay-to-win. You still have to earn some things, and you can earn them alongside non-paid members.
- Let's use the Danc-ohlic role, for example. A booster can start the party (with booster commands), but 5 people need to join to earn a role from it! And they don't all have to be boosters!
- Our aim is for the moment, not just a pay-and-collect system. WAIT, that sounds kinda bad. YOU GET IT! Only for good meanings.
- You get the perks and more opportunities, not just perks and roles!
- Sido bot handles a good amount of the server's perk system, and there is a public build that is unstable, but hey! Maybe one day we'll drop a text and next thing you know, Sido is chilling in your server XD.
- **Sido** is our mascot :>
- He literally has a Discord account!
- Sido (bot) existed in Wolf Den! But how, if Sido didn't exist since Darsid NEVER existed yet? Great question!
- Template Bot/Wolf Den Support Bot was originally the server's bot, which was later dismissed and rebuilt with another vision from the ground up!
- When Sido was made, we thought... WHAT if we continued? That's why I'm interested in having a public bot too, since Template Bot used to be free to all. It just takes a lot of time.
- Darsid Studio almost got called Darsidy Studios.
- All official socials are on our [Linktree](https://tldrlink.com/r/Darsid)!

