# INFO

## Tickets

You can use tickets to get or request the addition of social roles.

## Social

You can earn the **CREATOR** role if you have promoted the server or are actively promoting it, which helps us a butt ton!

Promoting the server is NOT required to get social roles. It's just an optional action that earns you another role :>

## Reports

We accept PRIVATE reports through our dedicated reports channel.

Please do NOT DM staff or the owner unless you've been wrongfully punished and CANNOT communicate on the server.

If that's the case, drop a "HELP ME" in our DMs.

You can report anything, including a user, a server bug, etc.

## Earnable Roles

We have a Role Rarity Board and a few fun ways to earn roles!

We'll keep adding new ways and eventually create something for members who have earned them all!

Collector roles won't count.
